{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（15日）上午9時51分，跑馬地集祥街6號一間菜檔的店員報案，指飼養的貓隻被人偷去。與此同時，她在網上發文尋貓，指被盜的雄性花貓叫「蒜頭」，現年4歲，戴有米黃色項圈及連帶 Airtag 的綠色圓扣，昨日（14日）失蹤。店主透過尋找功能發現「蒜頭」的 Airtag 訊號曾於今日凌晨1時許在屯門新安街出現，最新定位則停留在新安街一間工業大廈。警方到場列盜竊案，正追緝偷貓賊。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員在菜檔調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187366316617895936608314.jpeg/Py2Hgep8OwE-51dAckGstCECgDKFzXzhXRq8eHgavHg\"/><figcaption>警員在菜檔調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><p>店員稱，今日清晨4時許返回菜檔開舖不見「蒜頭」蹤影，至早上8時左右還未見牠現身，透過追蹤應用程式搜尋其位置，赫然發現竟然顯示在屯門，懷疑「蒜頭」遭人偷走，連忙報警求助，並在網上發文尋貓。</p><figure><img alt=\"涉事店舖為一間菜檔。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187366313870495744783415.jpeg/Lfux-kg8-kHJaA0NlNyV-mOWQpUXTeFZeGWLjV1li40\"/><figcaption>涉事店舖為一間菜檔。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在店內調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187366311043403776290371.jpeg/7a3QrDEGSCNRjtrMUkIOekLxlySJbt6Egb-qGqS_qho\"/><figcaption>警員在店內調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店主發文尋貓。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187373381406691328814359.jpeg/7s792--9d7ZM9dTkS9gDJYvOQlRWperxeuEmS1_hJks\"/><figcaption>店主發文尋貓。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Airtag顯示「蒜頭」在屯門。（threads: huuiii_912 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187366728661733376428371.jpeg/M5KJbwePrzPitSU8qnWUepWXEt-diVIt_iwvwP4sL8A\"/><figcaption>Airtag顯示「蒜頭」在屯門。（threads: huuiii_912 圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Airtag顯示「蒜頭」在屯門。（threads: huuiii_912 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187366730838708224315290.jpeg/ge-Rq7hBwQY52vaNL20aFRi55RFJ2nqn90tczPdLXMw\"/><figcaption>Airtag顯示「蒜頭」在屯門。（threads: huuiii_912 圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「蒜頭」懷疑遭人盜去。（threads: huuiii_912 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187366733183455232548971.jpeg/VUS94zaKFOZ55w0nQAyV5XtTRs_O9ISN2a2ledmtpXk\"/><figcaption>「蒜頭」懷疑遭人盜去。（threads: huuiii_912 圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「蒜頭」懷疑遭人盜去。（threads: huuiii_912 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187366735771471872831479.jpeg/GOB-qGeWpKU4Q1tM6ljl7z-qRv85Alc-4lHuBOJR7gQ\"/><figcaption>「蒜頭」懷疑遭人盜去。（threads: huuiii_912 圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「蒜頭」懷疑遭人盜去。（threads: huuiii_912 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187366737948446720520841.jpeg/nr-6ZISrJBEsOpjGqhDpfbH120nai-rx2CC7z9ggu88\"/><figcaption>「蒜頭」懷疑遭人盜去。（threads: huuiii_912 圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「蒜頭」懷疑遭人盜去。（threads: huuiii_912 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187366728267468800870193.jpeg/uR6PYH1qIVoQJvzFTD7pXFokwIwjarC4dxutjHcbrYw\"/><figcaption>「蒜頭」懷疑遭人盜去。（threads: huuiii_912 圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:35.923179+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":569,"images":10,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T03:56:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T10:38:02.892756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:07.779703+00:00","content_hash":"f9b0696b806cd91c10d924f6bace82363e01c864c29a291dbe7753d17381ae51","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}